IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `mlr-core`
IMPORT `mlr5-sch6a`

-- TESTS for Schedule 6A (the United Kingdom's Financial Intelligence Unit), lines 3349-3390.
-- Expected values are written from the text before the run.  A definition given with "means" answers JUST FALSE outside it;
-- a duty or permission whose "where" / "upon request" / "apply where" is not met answers JUST FALSE (rulings of 2026-11-05), and one stated for a scope with no such word, or subject to
-- paragraph 10 or 11, answers NOTHING outside it (the paragraph is limited by its own wording);
-- paragraphs 11 and 16(a) carry the text's own "is not required" and "unless" and answer JUST FALSE there.
-- The regulative rules are run with #TRACE at the foot; a #TRACE prints neither errors nor assertions, so those lines are
-- not counted in the assertion total (NOTES.md, "What the main binary does not accept").

§ `Paragraph 1 -- interpretation (lines 3350-3359)`

#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the request is an external request` WITH `the request is made to the NCA` IS TRUE, `the request is made by a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the information requested may be relevant for the foreign FIU's performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the request is an external request` WITH `the request is made to the NCA` IS FALSE, `the request is made by a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the information requested may be relevant for the foreign FIU's performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the request is an external request` WITH `the request is made to the NCA` IS TRUE, `the request is made by a foreign FIU` IS FALSE, `the information requested may be relevant for the foreign FIU's performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the request is an external request` WITH `the request is made to the NCA` IS TRUE, `the request is made by a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the information requested may be relevant for the foreign FIU's performance of FIU functions` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the authority is a foreign competent authority` WITH `the authority is in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the authority has functions equivalent to those of a United Kingdom competent authority` IS TRUE, `a foreign FIU may provide information to the authority in connection with its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the authority is a foreign competent authority` WITH `the authority is in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the authority has functions equivalent to those of a United Kingdom competent authority` IS TRUE, `a foreign FIU may provide information to the authority in connection with its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the authority is a foreign competent authority` WITH `the authority is in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the authority has functions equivalent to those of a United Kingdom competent authority` IS FALSE, `a foreign FIU may provide information to the authority in connection with its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the authority is a foreign competent authority` WITH `the authority is in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the authority has functions equivalent to those of a United Kingdom competent authority` IS TRUE, `a foreign FIU may provide information to the authority in connection with its performance of FIU functions` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the authority is a foreign FIU` WITH `the authority is in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the authority performs FIU functions in that state` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the authority is a foreign FIU` WITH `the authority is in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the authority performs FIU functions in that state` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the authority is a foreign FIU` WITH `the authority is in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the authority performs FIU functions in that state` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the information is relevant information` WITH `the NCA possesses the information in connection with its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers the information relevant to an external request` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the information is relevant information` WITH `the NCA possesses the information in connection with its performance of FIU functions` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers the information relevant to an external request` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the information is relevant information` WITH `the NCA possesses the information in connection with its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers the information relevant to an external request` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- an authority other than the NCA concerned in the offences, to which the NCA disseminates
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the body is a United Kingdom competent authority` WITH `the body is the NCA` IS FALSE, `the body is concerned in the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences contained in Part 7 (money laundering) of the 2002 Act or Part 3 (terrorist property) of the 2000 Act` IS TRUE, `the body is a supervisory authority` IS FALSE, `the NCA disseminates information to the body in its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the NCA itself is not 'an authority other than the NCA' (limb one); it is not made a competent authority by being concerned
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the body is a United Kingdom competent authority` WITH `the body is the NCA` IS TRUE, `the body is concerned in the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences contained in Part 7 (money laundering) of the 2002 Act or Part 3 (terrorist property) of the 2000 Act` IS TRUE, `the body is a supervisory authority` IS FALSE, `the NCA disseminates information to the body in its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a supervisory authority to which the NCA disseminates
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the body is a United Kingdom competent authority` WITH `the body is the NCA` IS FALSE, `the body is concerned in the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences contained in Part 7 (money laundering) of the 2002 Act or Part 3 (terrorist property) of the 2000 Act` IS FALSE, `the body is a supervisory authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA disseminates information to the body in its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the NCA does not disseminate to the body: the text's last words fail
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the body is a United Kingdom competent authority` WITH `the body is the NCA` IS FALSE, `the body is concerned in the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences contained in Part 7 (money laundering) of the 2002 Act or Part 3 (terrorist property) of the 2000 Act` IS TRUE, `the body is a supervisory authority` IS FALSE, `the NCA disseminates information to the body in its performance of FIU functions` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the body is a United Kingdom competent authority` WITH `the body is the NCA` IS FALSE, `the body is concerned in the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences contained in Part 7 (money laundering) of the 2002 Act or Part 3 (terrorist property) of the 2000 Act` IS FALSE, `the body is a supervisory authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA disseminates information to the body in its performance of FIU functions` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- neither concerned in the offences nor a supervisory authority
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the body is a United Kingdom competent authority` WITH `the body is the NCA` IS FALSE, `the body is concerned in the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences contained in Part 7 (money laundering) of the 2002 Act or Part 3 (terrorist property) of the 2000 Act` IS FALSE, `the body is a supervisory authority` IS FALSE, `the NCA disseminates information to the body in its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- FORK S6A-F2: 'other than the NCA' is read to qualify the first kind only, so a supervisory authority that is the NCA is still within the definition
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 1 the body is a United Kingdom competent authority` WITH `the body is the NCA` IS TRUE, `the body is concerned in the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences contained in Part 7 (money laundering) of the 2002 Act or Part 3 (terrorist property) of the 2000 Act` IS FALSE, `the body is a supervisory authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA disseminates information to the body in its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the pointers
#ASSERT `sch 6A para 1 FIU functions are` EQUALS "the functions of a financial intelligence unit as set out in the fourth money laundering directive"
#ASSERT `sch 6A para 1 the defined Act is` `sch 6A para 1 the 2000 Act` EQUALS "the Terrorism Act 2000"
#ASSERT `sch 6A para 1 the defined Act is` `sch 6A para 1 the 2002 Act` EQUALS "the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002"

§ `Paragraph 2 -- Reports to the National Crime Agency (line 3361)`

-- sch 6A para 2: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 2 the authority must provide a report to the NCA` WITH `the NCA has disseminated information to the authority in its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE, `the authority is a United Kingdom competent authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA has requested a report from the authority` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 2: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA has disseminated information to the authority in its performance of FIU functions
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 2 the authority must provide a report to the NCA` WITH `the NCA has disseminated information to the authority in its performance of FIU functions` IS FALSE, `the authority is a United Kingdom competent authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA has requested a report from the authority` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 2: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the authority is a United Kingdom competent authority
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 2 the authority must provide a report to the NCA` WITH `the NCA has disseminated information to the authority in its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE, `the authority is a United Kingdom competent authority` IS FALSE, `the NCA has requested a report from the authority` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 2: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA has requested a report from the authority
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 2 the authority must provide a report to the NCA` WITH `the NCA has disseminated information to the authority in its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE, `the authority is a United Kingdom competent authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA has requested a report from the authority` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraph 3 -- Co-operation (line 3363)`

-- sch 6A para 3: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 3 the NCA must take such steps as it considers appropriate to co-operate with the foreign FIU` WITH `the other body is a foreign FIU` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 3: the condition fails (the paragraph is limited by its own wording): the other body is a foreign FIU
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 3 the NCA must take such steps as it considers appropriate to co-operate with the foreign FIU` WITH `the other body is a foreign FIU` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Paragraph 4 -- Provision of information in response to external requests (line 3365)`

-- sch 6A para 4: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 4 the NCA must provide promptly any relevant information in its possession` WITH `the request is an external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA possesses relevant information` IS TRUE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 4: the condition fails (the paragraph is limited by its own wording): the request is an external request
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 4 the NCA must provide promptly any relevant information in its possession` WITH `the request is an external request` IS FALSE, `the NCA possesses relevant information` IS TRUE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- sch 6A para 4: the condition fails (the paragraph is limited by its own wording): the NCA possesses relevant information
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 4 the NCA must provide promptly any relevant information in its possession` WITH `the request is an external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA possesses relevant information` IS FALSE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- sch 6A para 4: the exception applies ("subject to": NOTHING): the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 4 the NCA must provide promptly any relevant information in its possession` WITH `the request is an external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA possesses relevant information` IS TRUE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Paragraph 5 -- Information from a relevant person (lines 3366-3368)`

-- sch 6A para 5: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(a) the NCA may exercise its powers to seek an order for information from the relevant person` WITH `an external request is received` IS TRUE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 5: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): an external request is received
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(a) the NCA may exercise its powers to seek an order for information from the relevant person` WITH `an external request is received` IS FALSE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 5: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(a) the NCA may exercise its powers to seek an order for information from the relevant person` WITH `an external request is received` IS TRUE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS FALSE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 5: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(a) the NCA may exercise its powers to seek an order for information from the relevant person` WITH `an external request is received` IS TRUE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 5: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(b) the NCA must provide to the foreign FIU the relevant information received in consequence of an order` WITH `an external request is received` IS TRUE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS TRUE, `the NCA has received relevant information in consequence of an order sought under paragraph 5(a)` IS TRUE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 5: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): an external request is received
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(b) the NCA must provide to the foreign FIU the relevant information received in consequence of an order` WITH `an external request is received` IS FALSE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS TRUE, `the NCA has received relevant information in consequence of an order sought under paragraph 5(a)` IS TRUE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 5: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(b) the NCA must provide to the foreign FIU the relevant information received in consequence of an order` WITH `an external request is received` IS TRUE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS FALSE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS TRUE, `the NCA has received relevant information in consequence of an order sought under paragraph 5(a)` IS TRUE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 5: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(b) the NCA must provide to the foreign FIU the relevant information received in consequence of an order` WITH `an external request is received` IS TRUE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS FALSE, `the NCA has received relevant information in consequence of an order sought under paragraph 5(a)` IS TRUE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 5: the condition fails (the paragraph is limited by its own wording): the NCA has received relevant information in consequence of an order sought under paragraph 5(a)
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(b) the NCA must provide to the foreign FIU the relevant information received in consequence of an order` WITH `an external request is received` IS TRUE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS TRUE, `the NCA has received relevant information in consequence of an order sought under paragraph 5(a)` IS FALSE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- sch 6A para 5: the exception applies ("subject to": NOTHING): the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 5(b) the NCA must provide to the foreign FIU the relevant information received in consequence of an order` WITH `an external request is received` IS TRUE, `the NCA does not possess information which it considers relevant to the external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA suspects that a relevant person possesses such information` IS TRUE, `the NCA has received relevant information in consequence of an order sought under paragraph 5(a)` IS TRUE, `the NCA has decided under paragraph 10 not to provide the information` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Paragraph 6 -- A point of contact (line 3369)`

#ASSERT `sch 6A para 6 the NCA must designate at least one point of contact` EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Paragraph 7 -- Consent to dissemination (line 3370)`

-- sch 6A para 7: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 7 the NCA must consent to the dissemination of the requested information` WITH `the NCA has provided relevant information to a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the foreign FIU has requested consent to disseminate some or all of the relevant information to a foreign competent authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 7: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA has provided relevant information to a foreign FIU
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 7 the NCA must consent to the dissemination of the requested information` WITH `the NCA has provided relevant information to a foreign FIU` IS FALSE, `the foreign FIU has requested consent to disseminate some or all of the relevant information to a foreign competent authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 7: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the foreign FIU has requested consent to disseminate some or all of the relevant information to a foreign competent authority
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 7 the NCA must consent to the dissemination of the requested information` WITH `the NCA has provided relevant information to a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the foreign FIU has requested consent to disseminate some or all of the relevant information to a foreign competent authority` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 7: the exception applies ("subject to": NOTHING): the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 7 the NCA must consent to the dissemination of the requested information` WITH `the NCA has provided relevant information to a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the foreign FIU has requested consent to disseminate some or all of the relevant information to a foreign competent authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- sch 6A para 7: the exception applies ("subject to": NOTHING): the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 7 the NCA must consent to the dissemination of the requested information` WITH `the NCA has provided relevant information to a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the foreign FIU has requested consent to disseminate some or all of the relevant information to a foreign competent authority` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Paragraph 8 -- Secure transmission (line 3371)`

-- sch 6A para 8: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 8 the NCA shall take such steps as it considers appropriate to ensure the information is transmitted securely` WITH `the NCA provides relevant information in response to an external request in accordance with this Schedule` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 8: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA provides relevant information in response to an external request in accordance with this Schedule
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 8 the NCA shall take such steps as it considers appropriate to ensure the information is transmitted securely` WITH `the NCA provides relevant information in response to an external request in accordance with this Schedule` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraph 9 -- Conditions and restrictions (line 3373)`

-- sch 6A para 9: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 9 the NCA may impose restrictions and conditions on the use of the information` WITH `the NCA provides relevant information in response to an external request in accordance with this Schedule` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 9: the condition fails (the paragraph is limited by its own wording): the NCA provides relevant information in response to an external request in accordance with this Schedule
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 9 the NCA may impose restrictions and conditions on the use of the information` WITH `the NCA provides relevant information in response to an external request in accordance with this Schedule` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Paragraph 10 -- Not providing information (line 3374)`

-- sch 6A para 10: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 10 the NCA may decide not to provide some or all of the information` WITH `an obligation arises under this Schedule for the NCA to provide relevant information in response to an external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that providing the information could be contrary to national law` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 10: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): an obligation arises under this Schedule for the NCA to provide relevant information in response to an external request
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 10 the NCA may decide not to provide some or all of the information` WITH `an obligation arises under this Schedule for the NCA to provide relevant information in response to an external request` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that providing the information could be contrary to national law` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 10: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA considers that providing the information could be contrary to national law
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 10 the NCA may decide not to provide some or all of the information` WITH `an obligation arises under this Schedule for the NCA to provide relevant information in response to an external request` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that providing the information could be contrary to national law` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraph 12 -- Particular regard (lines 3378-3381)`

-- sch 6A para 12: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 12(a) the NCA must have particular regard to the need for as unfettered an exchange of relevant information as possible` WITH `the NCA is making a decision under paragraph 10` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 12: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA is making a decision under paragraph 10
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 12(a) the NCA must have particular regard to the need for as unfettered an exchange of relevant information as possible` WITH `the NCA is making a decision under paragraph 10` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 12: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 12(b) the NCA must have particular regard to the need for as unfettered dissemination of information by the foreign FIU as possible` WITH `the NCA is making a decision under paragraph 11` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 12: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA is making a decision under paragraph 11
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 12(b) the NCA must have particular regard to the need for as unfettered dissemination of information by the foreign FIU as possible` WITH `the NCA is making a decision under paragraph 11` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraph 13 -- Requests by the NCA to foreign FIUs (line 3383)`

-- sch 6A para 13: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 13 paragraphs 14 and 15 apply` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS TRUE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 13: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 13 paragraphs 14 and 15 apply` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS FALSE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 13: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 13 paragraphs 14 and 15 apply` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS TRUE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraph 14 -- The request goes to the foreign FIU (line 3384)`

-- sch 6A para 14: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 14 the NCA must address the request to the foreign FIU in the state of the head office` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS TRUE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 14: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 14 the NCA must address the request to the foreign FIU in the state of the head office` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS FALSE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 14: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 14 the NCA must address the request to the foreign FIU in the state of the head office` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS TRUE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraph 15 -- The content of the request (line 3385)`

-- sch 6A para 15: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 15 the request must contain the relevant facts, the reasons and the proposed use` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS TRUE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the NCA makes a request to a foreign FIU for information` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that the information may be relevant for its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 15: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 15 the request must contain the relevant facts, the reasons and the proposed use` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS FALSE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the NCA makes a request to a foreign FIU for information` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that the information may be relevant for its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 15: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 15 the request must contain the relevant facts, the reasons and the proposed use` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS TRUE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS FALSE, `the NCA makes a request to a foreign FIU for information` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that the information may be relevant for its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 15: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA makes a request to a foreign FIU for information
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 15 the request must contain the relevant facts, the reasons and the proposed use` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS TRUE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the NCA makes a request to a foreign FIU for information` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that the information may be relevant for its performance of FIU functions` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 15: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA considers that the information may be relevant for its performance of FIU functions
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 15 the request must contain the relevant facts, the reasons and the proposed use` WITH `the NCA wishes to obtain information concerning a relevant person` IS TRUE, `the relevant person has its head office in an EEA state other than the United Kingdom` IS TRUE, `the NCA makes a request to a foreign FIU for information` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that the information may be relevant for its performance of FIU functions` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraph 16 -- Conditions on information received (lines 3387-3390)`

#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 16(a) the NCA must use the information only for the purpose for which it was sought or provided` WITH `the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the NCA has obtained the prior consent of the foreign FIU to another use of the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 'unless it has obtained the prior consent of the foreign FIU to any other use': the text's own exception
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 16(a) the NCA must use the information only for the purpose for which it was sought or provided` WITH `the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU` IS TRUE, `the NCA has obtained the prior consent of the foreign FIU to another use of the information` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- information not received from a foreign FIU: outside the paragraph
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 16(a) the NCA must use the information only for the purpose for which it was sought or provided` WITH `the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU` IS FALSE, `the NCA has obtained the prior consent of the foreign FIU to another use of the information` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 16(a) the NCA must use the information only for the purpose for which it was sought or provided` WITH `the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU` IS FALSE, `the NCA has obtained the prior consent of the foreign FIU to another use of the information` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 16: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 16(b) the NCA must comply with the restrictions or conditions of use imposed by the foreign FIU` WITH `the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 16: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 16(b) the NCA must comply with the restrictions or conditions of use imposed by the foreign FIU` WITH `the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- sch 6A para 16: the case in which it arises
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 16(c) the NCA must obtain the prior consent of the foreign FIU to any further dissemination` WITH `the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- sch 6A para 16: the "where" / "upon" condition is not met (JUST FALSE, ruling of 2026-11-05): the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 16(c) the NCA must obtain the prior consent of the foreign FIU to any further dissemination` WITH `the NCA receives information from a foreign FIU` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Paragraph 11 -- when the NCA is not required to consent (lines 3375-3377)`

#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 11 the NCA is required to give the consent under paragraph 7` WITH `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 11 the NCA is required to give the consent under paragraph 7` WITH `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 11 the NCA is required to give the consent under paragraph 7` WITH `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS TRUE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- neither limb: paragraph 11 removes nothing, and whether the duty arises is paragraph 7's
#ASSERT (`sch 6A para 11 the NCA is required to give the consent under paragraph 7` WITH `the NCA considers that giving the consent could prejudice an investigation of a kind described in paragraph 11(a)` IS FALSE, `the NCA considers that giving the consent could be contrary to national law` IS FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `The regulative rules -- run, not asserted`

-- sch 6A para 2: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 2 the report duty` TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A a United Kingdom competent authority` DOES `sch 6A provide a report to the NCA about the authority's use of the information, including the outcome of any investigations or inspections` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 2: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 2 the report duty` FALSE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 3: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 3 the co-operation duty` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A take such steps as the NCA considers appropriate to co-operate with foreign FIUs` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 3: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 3 the co-operation duty` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 4: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 4 the duty to provide information` TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A provide promptly any relevant information in the NCA's possession` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 4: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 4 the duty to provide information` FALSE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 5: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 5(a) the power to seek an order` TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A exercise the powers to seek an order for information from the relevant person` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 5: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 5(b) the duty to pass on the information received` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A provide promptly to the foreign FIU the relevant information received in consequence of the order` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 5: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 5(b) the duty to pass on the information received` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 6: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 6 the duty to designate a point of contact`  AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A designate at least one point of contact with responsibility for receiving external requests` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 7: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 7 the duty to consent to dissemination` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A consent to the dissemination of as much of the requested information as possible and communicate the consent promptly` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 7: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 7 the duty to consent to dissemination` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 8: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 8 the duty to transmit securely` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A take such steps as the NCA considers appropriate to ensure the information is transmitted securely` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 8: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 8 the duty to transmit securely` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 9: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 9 the power to impose restrictions and conditions` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A impose such restrictions and conditions on the use of the information as the NCA considers appropriate` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 10: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 10 the power to decide not to provide information` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A decide not to provide some or all of the information` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 12: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 12(a) the duty to have regard to the exchange of information` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A have particular regard to the need for as unfettered an exchange of relevant information as possible` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 12: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 12(a) the duty to have regard to the exchange of information` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 12: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 12(b) the duty to have regard to dissemination` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A have particular regard to the need for as unfettered dissemination of information by the foreign FIU as possible` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 12: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 12(b) the duty to have regard to dissemination` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 14: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 14 the duty to address the request to the foreign FIU` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A address the request for the information to the foreign FIU in the state in which the relevant person has its head office` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 14: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 14 the duty to address the request to the foreign FIU` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 15: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 15 the duty on the content of the request` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A put in the request the relevant facts and background information, the reasons for the request and how the information is proposed to be used` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 15: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 15 the duty on the content of the request` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 16: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 16(a) the duty to use the information only for its purpose` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A use the information only for the purpose for which it was sought or provided` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 16: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 16(a) the duty to use the information only for its purpose` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 16: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 16(b) the duty to comply with the foreign FIU's restrictions` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A comply with the restrictions or conditions of use imposed by the foreign FIU` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 16: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 16(b) the duty to comply with the foreign FIU's restrictions` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 5
-- sch 6A para 16: the duty or permission arises and the party acts
#TRACE `sch 6A para 16(c) the duty to obtain consent to further dissemination` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `sch 6A the NCA` DOES `sch 6A obtain the prior consent of the foreign FIU to any further dissemination of the information` AT 1
-- sch 6A para 16: the first condition fails, so there is nothing to do
#TRACE `sch 6A para 16(c) the duty to obtain consent to further dissemination` FALSE AT 0 WITH
